option.SURFACE_COLORS.comment=When None, the object's base color is \
	disregarded in favor of simply treating every surface as white. \
	With vertex color, only the texture color is disregarded, so foliage \
	remains green. \
	Useful for debugging lighting. \
	Alpha testing is still applied.
